    "sectionTitle": "Copyright & Licenses — AI Image Generation Guidelines",
    "updated": "Last updated: August 9, 2026",
    "intro": "When using emaki images, many people wonder whether classical works are free to use, or how licenses differ between overseas and Japanese institutions. This page explains how copyright and licenses apply to emaki images and provides practical guidelines for safe reuse. This page is for information purposes only and is not legal advice.",
